    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="22.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 22.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ to æghwilces apostoles heahtide fæste man georne, butan to Philippus ⁊ Iacobus freolse ne beode we nan fæsten for þam easterlican freolse, butan hwa wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And at the festival of every apostle fasting shall be strictly observed, except that at the festival of Philip and James we enjoin no fast, because of the Easter festival unless anyone desires to fast.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ to æghwilces apostoles heahtide fæste man georne, buton Philippus ⁊ Iacobus freolse ne beode we nán fæsten for ðam eastran dæges freolse; elles oðre freolsa ⁊ fæstena healde man georne, swa swa þa heoldon þa ðe betst heoldon,</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
